# Test data rules

## Vector hashes

Run "make fixtures" to generate the vector hashes in internal/event/testdata.
Never edit these hashes by hand.

The expected canonical text is written by hand from RFC 8785.
The target hashes that text. It does not hash the encoder output.

To change a vector:

1. Edit the canonical text.
2. Run "make fixtures".
3. Run "make test".
4. Commit the text and the hashes together.

To add a vector, give it a sha256 field with an empty value, then do the
steps above.

## Signed notes

Run "make fixtures" to generate the golden section of
internal/tlog/verifier/testdata/notes.txt. The golden section holds the signed note
that TestTU12_Golden makes. Never edit it by hand.

The other sections are note text that is written by hand.

To change a note text:

1. Edit the text in the section.
2. Run "make fixtures". It keeps the comment lines and the other sections.
3. Run "make test".
4. Commit the text and the golden section together.
